31},{"text":"적은","x":967,"y":1190,"width":49,"height":28},{"text":"리소스를","x":1027,"y":1190,"width":98,"height":30},{"text":"사용하면서","x":1134,"y":1192,"width":125,"height":30},{"text":"가장","x":1272,"y":1193,"width":55,"height":29},{"text":"빠르게)","x":1338,"y":1193,"width":94,"height":31}]},{"text":"수행하기 위한 처리 루틴을 생성해야 하는데, 그것을 실행계획(execution plan)이라고 한다. 빠른 쿼리 수행을","words":[{"text":"수행하기","x":162,"y":1238,"width":92,"height":29},{"text":"위한","x":267,"y":1238,"width":48,"height":28},{"text":"처리","x":326,"y":1237,"width":44,"height":29},{"text":"루틴을","x":384,"y":1236,"width":71,"height":28},{"text":"생성해야","x":467,"y":1235,"width":96,"height":29},{"text":"하는데,","x":574,"y":1236,"width":79,"height":32},{"text":"그것을","x":666,"y":1238,"width":73,"height":29},{"text":"실행계획(execution","x":751,"y":1237,"width":222,"height":32},{"text":"plan)이라고","x":986,"y":1236,"width":141,"height":33},{"text":"한다.","x":1139,"y":1238,"width":57,"height":29},{"text":"빠른","x":1210,"y":1238,"width":54,"height":29},{"text":"쿼리","x":1276,"y":1238,"width":53,"height":29},{"text":"수행을","x":1345,"y":1239,"width":89,"height":28}]},{"text":"위해 내부적으로 생성한 일종의 프로시저와 같은 것이라고 이해하면 쉽다.","words":[{"text":"위해","x":163,"y":1283,"width":46,"height":28},{"text":"내부적으로","x":224,"y":1283,"width":116,"height":28},{"text":"생성한","x":352,"y":1283,"width":71,"height":28},{"text":"일종의","x":436,"y":1281,"width":68,"height":29},{"text":"프로시저와","x":519,"y":1282,"width":121,"height":29},{"text":"같은","x":653,"y":1283,"width":49,"height":28},{"text":"것이라고","x":715,"y":1283,"width":96,"height":28},{"text":"이해하면","x":823,"y":1282,"width":95,"height":29},{"text":"쉽다.","x":931,"y":1280,"width":56,"height":30}]},{"text":"쿼리 구문을 분석해서 문법 오류 및 실행 권한 등의 처나 최적화(Optimzation) 과정을 거쳐 실행계획 생성,","words":[{"text":"쿼리","x":193,"y":1328,"width":45,"height":27},{"text":"구문을","x":250,"y":1329,"width":70,"height":27},{"text":"분석해서","x":330,"y":1328,"width":93,"height":28},{"text":"문법","x":435,"y":1327,"width":45,"height":29},{"text":"오류","x":493,"y